                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 853.00/85.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Gage to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-10-06"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">October 6,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Since October 5, 5 p.m., city unusually quiet. People apprehensive but orderly.
                    Provisional government is in charge of foreign office and all national offices
                    in Lisbon. King and royal family fled last night aboard the royal yacht.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gage.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
